I get down from the bus.
This is a busy area of South Mumbai.
There is a lot of crowd here.
I remember the bus conductor's words.
"Go straight."
"Go towards the sea."
I walk straight.
But there are many streets here.
I turn left by mistake.
This is a big commercial street.
Many people are walking on the street.
There are shops on both sides.
I walk ahead on this street.
I search for the sea.
But I do not see the sea.
I am walking away from the water.
I stop on the street.
I am lost.
